{"id":"H0284","lemma":"אֲחִיחֻד","transliteration":"achichud","sayIt":"a-chi-CHUD","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ahihud","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.7;\nson of: Ehud (H0164);\nbrother of: Naaman (H5283J), Ahijah (H0281K), Gera (H1617J) and Uzza (H5798H)\n§ Ahihud = \"brother of mystery\"\na Benjamite, son of Ehud","glosses":["ahihud"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Ahihud","kjv":"and Ahihud"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:7","note":"Naaman, Ahijah, and Gera, who carried them captive; and he became the father of Uzza and Ahihud.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0164","lemma":"אֵהוּד","transliteration":"ehud","gloss":"Ehud"},{"id":"H0281","lemma":"אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ","transliteration":"achiyyah","gloss":"Ahijah"},{"id":"H5283","lemma":"נַעֲמָן","transliteration":"naaman","gloss":"Naaman"},{"id":"H1617","lemma":"גֵּרָא","transliteration":"gera","gloss":"Gera"},{"id":"H5798","lemma":"עֻזָּא","transliteration":"uzza","gloss":"Uzzah"},{"id":"H0261","lemma":"אֵחוּד","transliteration":"echud","gloss":"Ehud"},{"id":"H1540","lemma":"הֶגְלָם","transliteration":"galah","gloss":"Heglam"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}